<title>THAILAND: Thailand okays decrees on finance, property steps.</title>
<headline>Thailand okays decrees on finance, property steps.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai cabinet on Tuesday approved four executive decrees to encourage cash-strapped finance firms to merge and outline measures to bail out finance and property firms hit by a prolonged liquidity crunch and business slump, government officials said.</p>
<p>No details of the decrees were available immediately.</p>
</text>
